{"3241560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tossdown", "steam_appid": 3241560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver packages in a world where everything’s out to kill you, escape wild hazards and enemies, fight back using wacky power-ups and choose from a variety of perks to improve your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELIVER PACKAGES ON TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time to deliver packages, navigate the chaos and outsmart enemies. Every delivery is a high-stakes mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.poster.avif?t=1783954030\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.webm?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.mp4?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE CRAZY OBSTACLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dash to weave your way through a barrage of outrageous obstacles. Jump on cars for an extra boost, climb on buildings to escape the mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/8b43381a8ef94fbc63437341aabd4988.poster.avif?t=1783954030\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/8b43381a8ef94fbc63437341aabd4988.webm?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/8b43381a8ef94fbc63437341aabd4988.mp4?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT BACK WITH WACKY POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wild power-ups, blast enemies, boost your speed and defy gravity with outrageous abilities. Take control of the chaos and survive against all odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3b3cd3a26e5310ac0921f3aedc5443bd.poster.avif?t=1783954030\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3b3cd3a26e5310ac0921f3aedc5443bd.webm?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3b3cd3a26e5310ac0921f3aedc5443bd.mp4?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR PLAY STYLE WITH PERKS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between deliveries, choose from over 50+ unique perks that dramatically change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3946854741db46033502597508edb056.poster.avif?t=1783954030\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3946854741db46033502597508edb056.webm?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/3946854741db46033502597508edb056.mp4?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50+ perks to alter your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique characters with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ power-ups </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes with unique set of challenges, hazards and enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver packages in a world where everything’s out to kill you, escape wild hazards and enemies, fight back using wacky power-ups and choose from a variety of perks to improve your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELIVER PACKAGES ON TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time to deliver packages, navigate the chaos and outsmart enemies. Every delivery is a high-stakes mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.poster.avif?t=1783954030\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.webm?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241560/extras/2679b1c8c62f3ab7bf215e30bb24e392.mp4?t=1783954030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE CRAZY OBSTACLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dash to weave your way through a barrage of outrageous obstacles. Jump on cars for an extra boost, climb on buildings to escape the mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http